          "text": "Let me understand the task:\n\n1. There's a Bioconda recipe for the `allelecount` package that currently builds for Linux-64 but fails for linux-aarch64 (ARM)\n2. I need to modify the recipe to:\n   - Support linux-aarch64 architecture\n   - Use parallel compilation based on CPU count\n   - Update metadata with proper licensing (GPL-3.0-only SPDX identifier, reference to license file)\n   - Add run_exports for semantic versioning\n   - Add the new platform to \"additional-platforms\"\n\nLet me first explore the workspace to find the allelecount recipe.\n",
